Now it is time to go home.
The rented racket is in my hand.
But I am very happy.
I go to the reception desk.
I return the racket to the staff member.
"Brother, here is your racket," I say.
"Thank you, Madam," he says.
"Did you like the club?" he asks.
"Yes, I really like playing here," I reply.
"Now I will come here every Thursday evening."
I step out of the club.
The weather outside is very nice.
I wait for my bus to go home.
Now I have new friends.
Amit, Neha, and Sanjay are very good players.
I can play well with them.
I really like my new Thursday routine.
I go back home happily.
